  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "27",
  "quote": "The written notice under subsection (1) or (2) shall specify the reason for entry, the day of entry and a time of entry between the hours of 8 a.m. and 8 p.m.",
  "reason": "Section 27(3) requires that entry with notice for repairs must specify a time of entry between the hours of 8 a.m. and 8 p.m. Because the clause permits entry outside those hours (from 7 a.m. to 10 p.m.) and omits specifying a time of entry, it conflicts with the Act and is void under section 4(1)."
}

